Maintainer: A-NAS <zhongwater123@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: oldlibs
Priority: optional
Depends: a-nas (= @VERSION@)
Description: transitional package: the A-NAS assistant is part of a-nas
 The AI assistant's trial on the Experimental NAS has become part of the
 a-nas package (docs/adr/0024), whose postinst takes a trial over once. This
 empty package lets a device that had the trial update to that release; the
 system update removes it with the next one.
